  m_text: "Cook your new friend a meal using fresh ingredients! \r\nClick the paper on the counter to read the recipe then follow its instructions.\nAll actions are done through clicking, listed instructions, or waiting. Click station to go there, click the counter space to return to a neutral position, click on either side of the cutting line to cut the food, click the food when you want it to go somewhere. Listed instructions include stirring by clicking and dragging. Waiting takes place when heating meat.\nIf the puppy wants your attention, make sure to toss it a chew toy so you can get back to work!\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
